#. "L_DAM_004"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_DAM_005"
msgid "Deactivate GPS and autopilot\n"
msgstr "ＧＰＳと自動運行装置を切れ\n"

#. "L_DAM_006"
msgid "Disable primary power source\n"
msgstr "母船のメイン電源を切れ\n"

#. "L_DAM_007"
msgid "Secure laboratories and research data\n"
msgstr "研究データを確保せよ\n"

#. "L_DAM_008"
msgid "Activate Moon Pool lift\n"
msgstr "ムーンプール・リフトを起動\n"

#. "L_DAM_009"
msgid "Rendezvous and escape with Elvis\n"
msgstr "エルビスと共に潜水せよ\n"

#. "L_DAM_010"
msgid ""
"Cripple the engines and the ship will \n"
"drift... Perfect!\n"
msgstr ""
"Cripple the engines and the ship will \n"
"drift... Perfect!\n"

#. "L_DAM_011"
msgid "This must be where the sub's controlled from.\n"
msgstr "ここがきっと自動遠隔操作を行う場所ね。\n"

#. "L_DAM_012"
msgid ""
"Without the autopilot and the GPS, the ship \n"
"will wander off station.\n"
msgstr ""
"自動運行とＧＰＳがなけりゃ\n"
"この母船もただようだけね、ハッハ！\n"

#. "L_DAM_013"
msgid ""
"They'll be unable to conduct any operations \n"
"without any power.\n"
msgstr "メイン電源を切ればいいのね…\n"

#. "L_DAM_014"
msgid "Autopilot system has been deactivated.\n"
msgstr "自動運行装置がＯＦＦされた\n"

#. "L_DAM_015"
msgid "GPS system has been deactivated.\n"
msgstr "ＧＰＳシステムがＯＦＦされた\n"

#. "L_DAM_016"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. "L_DAM_017"
msgid "Reactor shutdown control hatch opened.\n"
msgstr "電源のメインスイッチのハッチが開いた\n"

#. "L_DAM_018"
msgid "Reactor has been shut down.\n"
msgstr "メインスイッチがＯＦＦされた\n"

#. "L_DAM_019"
msgid "Diving control center has been located.\n"
msgstr "潜水作業コントロールセンターを発見した\n"

#. "L_DAM_020"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な人物が倒された\n"

#. "L_DAM_021"
msgid "Research data has been secured.\n"
msgstr "全ての研究データを確保した\n"

#. "L_DAM_022"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_DAM_023"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_DAM_024"
msgid "Research data disk\n"
msgstr "研究データ\n"

#. "L_DAM_025"
msgid "A research data disk\n"
msgstr "研究データ\n"

#. "L_DAM_026"
msgid "Picked up a research data disk.\n"
msgstr "研究データを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_DAM_027"
msgid "Critical mission personnel have been killed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な人物が倒された\n"

#. "L_DAM_028"
msgid "Lift door has been unlocked.\n"
msgstr "リフトのドアロックが開かれた\n"

#. "L_DAM_029"
msgid "Lift has been activated.\n"
msgstr "リフトが起動された\n"

#. "L_DAM_030"
msgid "Operation denied - hangar doors still closed.\n"
msgstr "オペレーション拒否　格納庫のドアが閉まったままです\n"

#. "L_DAM_031"
msgid "Unlocking sequence has been reset.\n"
msgstr "メインスイッチのロック解除がリセットされた\n"

#. "L_DAM_032"
msgid ""
"You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \n"
"We'll meet up later.\n"
msgstr ""
"ジョアンナ、先に行ってくれ。ミーは\n"
"海路図を探してくる。後で合流しよう！\n"

#. "L_DAM_033"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "エルビスが倒された\n"

#. "L_DAM_034"
msgid ""
"Joanna... What took you so long? Follow me - \n"
"let's get out of this old tub.\n"
msgstr ""
"ジョアンナ、遅いよ。　カモ～ン！\n"
"早くこんなボロ船から脱出しよう。\n"

#. "L_DAM_035"
msgid "Civilians have been killed.\n"
msgstr "民間人が倒された\n"

#. "L_DAM_036"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. "L_DAM_037"
msgid "Alarm has been activated.\n"
msgstr "アラームが起動された\n"

#. "L_DAM_038"
msgid "Alarm has been deactivated.\n"
msgstr "アラームが停止した\n"

#. "L_DAM_039"
msgid ""
"Right. The diving operation has been disrupted on the surface. \n"
"Time for a swim.\n"
msgstr ""
"よーし、母船でのヤツらの作業を\n"
"ジャマできたな。今度は海中だね。\n"

#. "L_DAM_040"
msgid "I hope the government don't want to use this ship anytime soon.\n"
msgstr ""
"政府が当面、この船を\n"
"使わないことをいのるわ。\n"

#. "L_DAM_041"
msgid "Do you think we were a little heavy-handed?\n"
msgstr "ミーたちって強引なのかな？\n"

#. "L_DAM_042"
msgid "Naaahhhh.\n"
msgstr "ＮＯ…\n"

#. "L_DAM_043"
msgid "Pull the plug on that now.\n"
msgstr "さっさとそのスイッチを切って！\n"

#. "L_DAM_044"
msgid "Switch this thing off.\n"
msgstr "こっちのスイッチも切るのよ！\n"

#. "L_DAM_045"
msgid "I'll shut it down.\n"
msgstr "わかったよ、やるよ…\n"

#. "L_DAM_046"
msgid "Please don't hurt me.\n"
msgstr "撃たないでくれ…\n"

#. "L_DAM_047"
msgid "Die, you traitors.\n"
msgstr "この裏切り者！\n"
